{"title":"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At the end of yesterday’s soccer game between Team Why and Team Zed, Team Why had scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> goals and Team Zed had scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> goals. At half-time of the game, Team Why had scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> goals and Team Zed had scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> goals. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/5/e55b6810db781e7d0c3f70e981fae71bd68c2040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44a11bc37e18ab5ede1b5624d4f7aea2ea358781.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />, how many possibilities are there for the ordered pair of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/4/3449e7cf6fae2654fc6201dec5d726df550b2102.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y, z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" />?<br />\n(In soccer, each team’s score is always a non-negative integer that never decreases as the game proceeds.)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Listing_Pairs_Out.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Listing_Pairs_Out)\">Solution 1 (Listing Pairs Out)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Listing Pairs Out)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realise that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> since Team Why had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> goals at the end and Team Zed had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> goals at the end.\n</p><p>We can list out all of the possibilities for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/4/3449e7cf6fae2654fc6201dec5d726df550b2102.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y, z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" /> based on the conditions:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b86f54134d69cad8793688a431aa907aaf2698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/6457ca2dcd40dc21d9aa0db18c66bbac9af4d899.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/5/2a5f89d3f7133140df636f513744cf04af597309.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/754e946d1a160f767f0f61cbd9460401c2d1c17f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31fa6b94e5a84b15c9a080cd52edc749580d90c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69273482bff8727194f6407e55ac1bfa94d9c555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e575424cbb00924687d2a4e7e2aa3b1bbcfec030.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7a25c234892fb8a7738bc31e5ccee3bf9ad5afc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/0/5506b58320deb5004bf2ed2f1a5e3e672d6e326e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a6a917716191facf6d17308cdb8119392b77732.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/6/d261236ea904095d8d185a456444545b5206013b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea44bd62795a5d84c16a028ff4fb079a5cb8e63f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Counting, we see that, in total, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/38693a75a9e00c962455566cda9d06d94da1738b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> possibilities.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Faster.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Faster)\">Solution 2 (Faster)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Faster)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like in solution 1, we can realise that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e16fb905a2344cb9d6034b02754e0a9b91bacc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 - 0 + 1 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities for Team Why and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/a/52a8468eb74f76b0b4a5d33b18e1003fb03e047c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 - 0 + 1 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities for Team Zed.\n</p><p>This means that, in total, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d0100e092144beb8e883f065cc25075636e435a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 3 = \\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"96\" height=\"25\" /> possibilities.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC\" title=\"2024 CSMC\">2024 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065716\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 228/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6468/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.389      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    8.389      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37443:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018065716 and revision id 289381. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}